	/// Executive summary narrative describing the Foster Program lifecycle, historical growth, operating maturity, and current outlook. Intended for executive consumption and strategic context.
	measure 'Executive Summary Narrative' =
			
			"• The Foster Program experienced significant expansion between "
			&
			FORMAT([First Reporting Year],"0")
			&
			" and "
			&
			FORMAT([Peak Year],"0")
			&
			" before transitioning into a mature and stable operating model." & UNICHAR(10) &
			"• Foster participation grew from 5,223 animals in 2006 to a peak of 15,763 in 2010." &
			UNICHAR(10) &
			"• Annual foster activity has remained stable at approximately 13,000–15,000 range since 2010." &
			UNICHAR(10) &
			"• Historical analysis confirms a consistent seasonal pattern, with peak foster participation occurring between June and October each year." &
			UNICHAR(10) &
			"• August 2026 performance remains aligned with historical expectations and recent operating trends." &
			UNICHAR(10) &
			"• Based on year-to-date activity through August 2026, the program is projected to support approximately 12,775 fostered animals by year-end."
		displayFolder: Capacity & Support\Executive Briefing
		lineageTag: 38efd936-9e46-4fd7-ac36-3401523feb88

	/// Executive summary headline describing the overall Foster Program growth pattern by comparing long-term and recent growth rates.
	/// 
	/// Used as the narrative headline for the Program Growth section.
	/// 
	/// Examples:
	/// 
	/// Historically yes. Recently stable.
	/// Historically yes. Continuing to grow.
	/// Historically yes. Recently slowing.
	/// Growth pattern requires review.
	measure 'Growth Headline' = ```
			
			VAR LongTermGrowth =
			    [Long-Term CAGR]
			
			VAR RecentGrowth =
			    [Recent CAGR]
			
			RETURN
			    SWITCH(
			        TRUE(),
			
			        LongTermGrowth > 0
			            && ABS(RecentGrowth) <= 0.01,
			            "Strong historical growth. Sustainable today.",
			
			        LongTermGrowth > 0
			            && RecentGrowth > 0.01,
			            "Historically yes. Continuing to grow.",
			
			        LongTermGrowth > 0
			            && RecentGrowth < -0.01,
			            "Historically yes. Recently slowing.",
			
			        "Growth pattern requires review."
			    )
			
			```
		displayFolder: Capacity & Support\Program Growth
		lineageTag: b6bcf7ba-272d-4305-9e4d-ec91c4e445b2

